{"des":"demo1005_1","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_132"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"scaleX":1.36,"scaleY":1.36,"layer":"bg","mirrow":false,"trans":false,"x":-25,"noOut":false,"y":-7.6400000000001,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"img":"bgNew","alpha":0}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1.36,"scaleY":1.36,"nonStandBright":false,"layer":"bg","mirrow":false,"trans":false,"x":-25,"noOut":false,"y":-7.6400000000001,"timeBak":300,"noIn":false,"transTime":0,"bright":1,"img":"bgNew","alpha":0}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【史学者巴妲】","text":"[show]我是旧日修行所的史学者巴妲。你就是从山口外来的工匠吗？[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_143"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":121,"noOut":false,"y":-289,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"img":"chara002_0","alpha":0}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":121,"noOut":false,"y":-289,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":1,"img":"chara002_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【米托拉】","text":"[show]……你有什么目的？直接给我们任务就好。[l]","nameSide":"left"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"text":"我是希尔，你指名的契约主。","tag":"tag_144"},{"text":"我只是一名被克里斯汀放逐的难民。","tag":"tag_144"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_144"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":121,"noOut":false,"y":-289,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":0.6,"img":"chara002_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【史学者巴妲】","text":"[cm][show]魔界山口那边发生的事件，我们的首座现在也略知一二。[r]为了调查这件事和五年前的“兽潮”……或者之后可能来临的“灾难”是否有关，[r]我想请希尔先生重返此处。[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_145"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":121,"noOut":false,"y":-289,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":1,"img":"chara002_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【米托拉】","text":"[show]你疯了？[r]今天可是“投食日”，我们逃出来的时候杀了小山一样多的黄毛怪，你有没有概念？[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"left"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_147"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":121,"noOut":false,"y":-289,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":0.6,"img":"chara002_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【史学者巴妲】","text":"[show]我想请你们去的地方，并不在离山口那么近的地方。[r]你们只需要去地图上的这个地方，探查一下符文石阵的状况。[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_148"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":641,"noOut":false,"y":-422,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"img":"chara012_0","alpha":0}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":641,"noOut":false,"y":-422,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":1,"img":"chara012_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【沃夫加】","text":"[show]这个位置据我所知，的确不是流放者的逃难路线。[r]他们更多的是直接前往那座伪造的绿洲……然后被北方的沙贼一网打尽。[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_149"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":641,"noOut":false,"y":-422,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":0.6,"img":"chara012_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【史学者巴妲】","text":"[show]正是如此。[r]至于去的理由……如果顺应首座的预言，您到了那里就会知道。[r]如何，契约主希尔先生……？[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_150"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":121,"noOut":false,"y":-289,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":1,"img":"chara002_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【米托拉】","text":"[show]你不会真的信她说的什么……神教，什么预言吧……？这里可是连祈雨舞都没人跳的地方哦？[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"left"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_151"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":641,"noOut":false,"y":-422,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":1,"img":"chara012_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":121,"noOut":false,"y":-289,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":0.3,"img":"chara002_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【沃夫加】","text":"[show]索利德山还是有跳祈雨舞的习俗的。我去过一两次，跳得非常好看……就是得花钱。[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"right"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_152"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":641,"noOut":false,"y":-422,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":0.6,"img":"chara012_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"x":121,"noOut":false,"y":-289,"noIn":false,"transTime":300,"bright":1,"img":"chara002_0","alpha":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【米托拉】","text":"[show]没和你说话啦！[l]","nameSide":"left"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"text":"是个简单的任务。","tag":"tag_153"},{"text":"只是看看就回，风险可以接受。","tag":"tag_153"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_153"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"【米托拉】","text":"[cm][show]……唉。我懂了。[r]现在你是老大，整备好就出发吧。[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"left"}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}],"script":"demo1005_1"}